-- Third batch of find / cities results (PRs #432-#448, 2026-11-09 to 11-11); the first batch produced after the prompt changes of §35 (22 DUPLICATE_OF lines in the reports).
-- Promoted on their own pages: Let's Mahj RVA (Richmond), La Jolla Community Center (San Diego), Lucky Tiles Mahjong & The Atelier (Noblesville, under Indianapolis), Peace Love Mahjong (Dallas, plus eight sessions at Where Dragons Play), MahjWithMoxi (San Francisco).
-- New: Newbury Town Library Mahjong Meetup (under Newburyport, "playing American Mah Jongg (NMJL rules)"), Denton TX (Winds of Laughter, the Texan Trippers open play at the First United Methodist Church; unpublished), and two Johnson County KS groups filed under Kansas City (Pinot's Palette Olathe: "Reading the National Mah Jongg League card"; JCCC Mah Jongg courses, page read: "American Mahjongg ... National Mahjongg League (NMJL) rules"; three Regnier Center sessions on Mondays, so 2026). Kansas City is back over five rows and is published again.
-- Not American: Hidden Tile (Taiwanese), San Diego Mahjong Club (Zung Jung / Riichi / MCR; three rows), Seattle Mahjong Club Group (Taiwanese) are retired.
-- Held: Friendswood (Hall's Hall), Sid Jacobson JCC (members-only open play), Rodeph Sholom, Johnson County Parks & Rec drop-ins, Bam Bam Room, Four Winds Lounge, Clover Club and the directory-only teachers.
