UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Kansas City''s American mahjong spans both sides of the state line. Kansas City Mahjong Club and KC Mahjong Club run lessons and open play at shops and venues around the metro, Park Hill District Office hosts a mahjong group, Pinot''s Palette in Olathe offers a Mahjong 101 class, and Johnson County Community College teaches Mah Jongg courses at its Regnier Center in Overland Park. Check each listing for dates and booking. If you are new, begin with a Mahjong 101 class at Pinot''s Palette or the college before joining open play.' WHERE "slug" = 'kansas-city';
